	</div><div class='btext_mm' style='padding: 2px; overflow: auto; width:510; word-wrap:break-word; margin: 0px 8px;'>So far so good, well balanced game play. All GM's are good. Players are friendly and eager to level up. I am enjoying right now and hope this will not end. Thank you. This is the server I am looking for and I am looking forward to win on WOE and earn respect.</div><div id='revinfo' style='height: 16px;'>
