				<td width=115><div style='width: 97; height: 20; background: url(images/overall.gif) repeat-x 0 0;'><!-- empty --></div></td>
				<td width=180 align='center'>Played for less than 1 month</td>
				<td width=70 align='right'>2026-11-01</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</div><div class='btext_mm' style='padding: 2px; overflow: auto; width:510; word-wrap:break-word; margin: 0px 8px;'>Been playing since the start (almost 2 weeks). Community is still microscopic, but GM is active in listening to feedback, implementing necessary or interesting changes and fixing bugs. The economy surrounding cards and Zeny is taking good shape in my opinion, and it makes me look forward to some unique changes in the server, which are still being discussed so I hope more people join in to offer their perspective in what could get better and add their experience. Everything is free by the way.</div><div id='revinfo' style='height: 16px;'>
