	</div><div class='btext_mm' style='padding: 2px; overflow: auto; width:510; word-wrap:break-word; margin: 0px 8px;'>its been almost 1 month since ive played Fenzura, it has auto attack but i really still enjoy playing manual grind like the classic experience, still the gms admin are easy to approach and listen to the players suggestion as long it was balance in the server, and the community are very much active.. if you want to join a classic 99/50 you are welcome here in FENZURA lets go!!</div><div id='revinfo' style='height: 16px;'>
